Brightness: AppleARMBacklight as ios-sailfish 0168 has it (sweetbacklight=2).

CoreBrightness takes the backlight-control service that conforms to AppleARMBacklight, reads
IODisplayParameters brightness {min, max, value} and sets {brightness, FadePeriod,
backlight-level}. Our earlier service had another class and nits keys and backboardd stalled
(all13bl, all14bl). 0..255 maps onto the panel's DCS 0x51 1..0x7ff, faded every 16 ms on its
own work loop, and becomes the level the lock fade starts from.

--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
@@ -182,20 +182,37 @@
